# CELESTIAL leans with the hand: a slow circle of tilt, then a hold in one pose.
# The stars slide by depth (near 6 px, middle 3, far 1 at full lean) and drift
# back to rest as the dial re-centres (about 3 s). Tilt is the in-plane UP
# vector in milli-g, screen axes; see docs/reference/tilt-parallax.md.
scene watch-celestial
wait 1500
tilt 0 0
wait 500
tilt orbit 4000 300   # one slow circle, 300 mg across
wait 4200
tilt 380 0           # full lean right and hold: the dial re-centres
wait 5000
tilt -380 160
wait 4000
